; cluster for computation concepts: algorithm, recursion, loop, function, conditional.
; computation is the execution of a sequence of steps that transforms input to output.
; all computation is kramanusara: each step is a transformation of the previous state.
; sangati roots

(kosha computation-varga
  (vishesa cs-varga)
  (swarupa subanta krama)
  (yukta niyama avastha kaala))
